        "original_id": "f4d91edb-4f08-5d61-ae7f-52e183c220e6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert B. Sherman\n- Products: \"It's a Small World\" song, It's a Small World ride\n- Organizations: Time.com, Walt Disney Parks and Resorts\n- Places: Disneyland Park, Magic Kingdom, Tokyo Disneyland, Disneyland Paris, Hong Kong Disneyland, Fantasyland, Anaheim, Lake Buena Vista\n\nFacts:\n- Time.com stated that the song \"It's a Small World\" is the most performed song of all time.\n- It's a Small World is a water-based dark ride located in the Fantasyland area at Walt Disney Parks and Resorts worldwide.\n- The It's a Small World ride is located at Disneyland Park in Anaheim, California.\n- The It's a Small World ride is located at the Magic Kingdom at Walt Disney World Resort in Lake Buena Vista, Florida.\n- The It's a Small World ride is located at Tokyo Disneyland, Disneyland Paris, and Hong Kong Disneyland.",
